{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_03_end","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-3","storyName":"油泼扯面","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"煌做的长寿面得到了小大厨的认可。惊蛰在得知还有其他方式能够转移学宫档案后，找到了新的调查方向。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["小大厨","煌","衣着光鲜的食客","景教授","麟青砚","左乐","？？？","太合","行箸"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_bg_58_g1_yusrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":6},{"type":"text","text":"一大早，小饭馆的门外尚冷清，仅有几只羽兽在落叶上来回蹦跶。","id":7},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wing","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"对门大理寺的值夜人打了个长长的呵欠，惊得羽兽四散飞离。","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":11,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"啊——呜……","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#19$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"昨晚做了噩梦，梦见有只循兽把我后厨里的面粉都吃光了。好可怕……","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"charslot","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.7","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"早！","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"请！","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你……学会了？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你这黑眼圈……难道真做了一整夜？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#6$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"哈哈，也就到后半宿吧……行箸到现在还没醒呢。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"先不说别的了，快尝尝这面！","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你……啊？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你没学会和面，就煮了一把挂面来给我交差？！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这可不是一般的挂面。这是行箸和我挑遍了市面上所有种类的挂面后，精心挑选出的口感最接近你做的面的一款。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"当然，相比于手工面，口感还是略差一些的。不过行箸还对你汤底配方稍微进行了一点调整——保证做出来的口味和你做的差不多。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"歪门邪说，投机取巧，还乱改我的配方！","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"先别急着下结论，你尝尝再说嘛！","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","focus":"n","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"小大厨皱着眉，用筷子挑起几缕面，小心翼翼地闻了闻，才送入口中。","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_eatnoodle_single","volume":"0.5","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"……唔。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"怎么样？","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"……嗯。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"说话啊！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你们……为什么会觉得这样做就能行？","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#4$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"主要是行箸都快饿得不行了。当时想着，与其就这么和面团干耗着，不如先用你的配方做碗我能做的面给她吃。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"后来想了想，长寿面最重要的可能不是味道，而是让吃面的人有被祝福的感觉。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"有些人就是学不会你这一手做面条的功夫，但是用一把挂面也能给自己或家人送上祝福，这就是长寿面的意义。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你看，这面条黄灿灿的，是不是比你那一碗看上去还热闹一点？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#7$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"呃……当然，投机取巧也是事实啦……","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你说“被祝福的感觉”……你觉得自己做出来了吗？","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我……应该吧？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"昨晚第一次成功做出这碗面的时候，我和行箸一起分享了。我觉得吃得很开心，她还偷偷抹眼泪来着……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"把手工面换成了挂面，也跟着调整了香油和盐的用量，倒也算动了脑子……那位姑娘的舌头真是厉害。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"但是挂面煮完需要过凉水，你做是做了，却没把凉水沥干。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"凉水留得太多，降低了汤的温度，也影响了整碗面的口感。要想精益求精的话，这些细节下次最好也要照顾到。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"啊……好，我记住了！","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"欸，你说这话的意思是……","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#3$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"打住，我就是看在你花了心思的分上，决定继续教你罢了。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"和面还是要接着练的，你总不能真的打算带着一把挂面去参加比赛吧？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嘿嘿，行！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"这只是师父心软，觉得徒弟开窍了一点。但客人到底买不买单，还是要检验一番的。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这……要怎么检验？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"等会儿客人来了，如果有点面条的，你就做一碗送去。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"客人要是觉得不好吃，那你就接着练习吧。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"……我这就去！","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_bg_58_g1_yusrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":106},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这位客人！要不要来一碗本店新推出的特色长寿面！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"今天又不是我的生日，怎么平白无故让我吃长寿面？","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"呃……小店菜品试新，让客人免费品尝！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不对……您要是吃完觉得满意，还是付一下钱比较好，我也得给我们老板交差……","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"真有意思，这小店的生意还有这种做法。","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"把面放下吧，就算我点的。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"（热切的眼神）","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"呃……还有事吗？","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"没，没！我就是想等您吃过后，听听您的评价。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"好好……我吃就是。","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dishes","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"食客拿起筷子，先后夹起一根面、一片青菜、一点葱花，都仔细品尝过。","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"他动作优雅，可不一会的工夫，一碗面已经见底。","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"味道如何？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"嗯……好吃，很好吃。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"真……真的？！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"这汤很鲜，所用食材也很讲究，如果再炖上一天一夜，味道能更完美。","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"可是我已经很饿了，等不了那么久。如果为了那点“完美”再等上一天一夜，我恐怕早就饿死了。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"他想要求一份完美的味道，但客人却等不住了。","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"即便我愿意等他，有些事也是没法再等下去了。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"您这话……","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"不要紧，你把我的话转告你们老板就行。","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"食客站起身，他衣服上的纹样流光溢彩，光线在他身侧扭曲虚化，让人看不清他的面孔。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"哎，您……您还没给钱呢！","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1236_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣着光鲜的食客","text":"从我账上扣吧。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_npc_1236_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":157},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"charslot","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":161},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_bg_58_g8_baizaoacademy.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":164},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":165,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"不管你要查的到底是什么，出去以后，千万不要说这份档案是从学宫拿到的，记住了？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"明白……","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"怎么了？还有什么问题吗？","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你还记不记得……1062年，那场血案……","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"……这可不是什么能随便谈起的话题。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"……我只是突然想起……","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你口中那位，支持学界变法改革，造福无数寒门学子的太师，和四十年前，弑君谋逆的太师，真的是同一个人吗……","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"……我没有办法回答你的问题。不了解的事，我绝不会妄言。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"我没有见过那位太师，只是曾经读过她一些关于民生政治的论著。从书中能看出作者的见识之深、学识之广，这也让我获益良多。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"但恐怕，人是很难一概而论的。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你这样说，不正意味着，你对于当年案件的结果，并不是完全相信的吗？","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"青砚，你脸上可从来藏不住事。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"你果然还是……","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"大理寺的卷宗，容不下不清不白的案件……不管是多大的案件。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这是大理寺少卿的职责。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"你要做的事，我不会劝你别做。可无论如何，你都要学会保护好自己。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"唉……你的父母入山闭关前还拜托我对你多加关照，你要是出了什么事，我可就没脸再去见他们了。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我又不是小辈，怎么会总要人照顾——","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"年轻的时候，任谁都是这样的想法。可作为母亲看着左乐一天天长大，我心里也压上了一块石头。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"当长辈的不惦记着孩子的安危，又能惦记些什么呢？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"可如果要让他们知道，我为了你的“安危”考虑，阻止你履行大理寺少卿的职责，他们才会真的怪我吧。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"多谢……姐姐……","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"唉……你口口声声叫我姐姐，可在我眼里，你一直都是和左乐一辈的孩子。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"说起来，玉门已经接近百灶，这几天，你还没有见过左将军？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"局势已经迫在眉睫。兵部日夜开会研究，他也必须坐镇一线。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"我和他，谁都不能擅离职守。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"……","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这场争端……难道真的无法避免了吗？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"这不是我可以决断的事。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"作为兵部参知，我的职责就是尽最大的努力，尽可能精准地演算战争结果。要是心存偏私，那就是对大炎万千百姓的不负责。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"你不会在你的职责中退让分毫，那我也一样。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"希望一切，平安顺遂……","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"倒也不用太过担心，如果是无可避免的结果，那不如泰然处之。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"中秋节的时候，要是自己一个人的话，就来家里吃顿饭吧。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"嗯，一定……","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"等等……我突然想起来。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"你刚才不是问我，谁可以修改学宫的档案资料？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"虽然是极端情况，但也的确有过这样的个例……","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你是说……","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"不，不能说是修改。但如果学宫里的某一份档案完全消失不见的话，那只能是转移去了一个地方——","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1620_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"景教授","text":"……刑部死狱。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_1620_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_bg_35_g7_zuosroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"……","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"父亲不在……？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"text","text":"距上次来到这里转眼已过了大半年的时间，屋中陈设未变，只有沙盘上，象征战火的标志又多出不少。","id":251},{"type":"text","text":"孤城拒守，两相遥望。","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"公子……","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"熟悉而厚重的声音在身后响起。","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"太合叔！","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"你……你的伤？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"半个月前才勉强可以行动，总算不用整日卧床了。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"左乐怔怔地看着眼前那已几乎不是自己记忆中容貌的太合。","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"风掀起了他斗篷的一角，左乐看到了那宽大衣袍下枯瘦的身形。","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"曾经那个铁打般的汉子，如今却是形销骨立，仿佛经不住城头的一阵风。","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#7$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"太合叔……","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"这身拳脚功夫不过是外物，我依然是肃政院的监察御史，心中抱负总有施展之处。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"公子若是还要这样挂怀，那就是看轻太合了。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"不……怎会……","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#8$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"太合叔一身才学，怎会被这区区伤病限制住！","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#6$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"……","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"倒是公子，大半年未见，看上去更壮实了些。将军见到你，应当欣慰。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"对了，父亲他……？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"将军这几天一直在与司岁台和兵部开会议事，几乎没有片刻闲暇。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"现在的局势……","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#2$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"只在旦夕。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"……现在朝中的态度，是不惜一战吗？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"大荒城变故发生后，岁兽一事已然不是司岁台所能控制。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"朝中内阁、六部，虽然还有些争议，但态度已经明确——","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#2$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"永绝后患。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#7$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"可是，这一战的后果……","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#1$1","id":302},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_bg_35_mini01_villagevacancy.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":310},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_35_g5_swordcastingworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2023_ling_1#1$1","id":318},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_bg_25_g07_fairyland_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":321},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1","id":327},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_25_g08_pavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":334},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_bg_35_g7_zuosroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":335},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我听说，月前，有其他秉烛人在百灶附近发现了那罪人的踪迹。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"是的……我也听说了此事。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"朝廷已经严加防备，出动了多位禁军。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#10$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"竟然连禁军都……","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#1$1","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"那罪人的手段难以预料，是当下最紧要的威胁。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#3$1","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我有一个猜想，或许……","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"现在百灶城中，还有一位代理人……","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"这一位“年纪”最小的代理人，也是最为特殊的一位。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"据司岁台的观测，他从走出那座陵墓起，这数百年里从未施展过任何权能。司岁台也不知该对他如何是好……","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"唯有一事可疑——百年前，他在望越狱后来到百灶，之后便一直逗留此处。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"望之前曾频繁地接触其他代理人，他这次回来，恐怕留在百灶的这一位，也在他的计划之内。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_299_1#4$1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太合","text":"公子有何打算？","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#2$1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我不知道……所以要先去看个明白。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左乐","text":"我自己去看。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_4121_zuole_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":361},{"type":"dialog","id":362},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"charslot","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":365},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_bg_58_g13_yuskitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":368},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":369,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"呼……完成！","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#7$1","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"怎么样？从洗菜开始的每一道工序，我已经记得滚瓜烂熟了！一点都不用人帮忙！","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"也多亏行箸帮我想的办法，只要在上手和面之前，先把手在冰水里泡上五分钟就没有问题了！","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"嗯……看上去成色不错，味道上也有些神似小大厨的手艺了。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"凑凑合合吧，还远谈不上以假乱真呢。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"要是我这么多年的手艺，被一个没下过厨的人随随便便就学会了，那我不是白混了。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"努力了这么多天，明天就要比赛了，你就不能说点鼓励的话……","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我是怕你得意忘形……不过留点心气也好，别到时候见了莫不服被吓得连菜刀都不会用了。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#21$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"没什么好怕的，莫不服倚老卖老，你就去给他一点年轻人的颜色看看。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"好！","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"万事俱备，明天就去决战鼎丰楼。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":394},{"type":"image","id":395},{"type":"charslot","id":396}],"characters":["小大厨","煌","衣着光鲜的食客","景教授","麟青砚","左乐","？？？","太合","行箸"]}